                                                <p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5=
em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">I just put up the remaining stock =
from the last production run on the Reflectacles website. These were pulled=
 before I sold out completely so I didn't oversell and get people yelling a=
t me (as people tend to do these days). There is not much, but you might fi=
nd what you are looking for. Some IRpair frames, some IRcloak, and the Univ=
ersal IRclip from the 2016 production run that are now 2 for the price of o=
ne (they have a more noticeable logo on the lens and some might even call t=
hem collector's items these days). I also just received a rush order of lig=
ht and dark lenses for the Ghost and Phantom, so I will sell those until th=
e supply of lenses is gone. But check out the site and see what is there at=
 the moment.</p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #=
15212A;">If you don't see what you want right now, don't stress. Everything=
 should be fully restocked at the end of August. There will be new addition=
s to the IRpair Turtles collection with some really neat colors. Updates wi=
ll be announced through this newsletter so please stay tuned if you are int=
erested.</p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #1521=
2A;">Please stick in there with me on shipping out the orders. Packages wil=
l be shipped once a week in the order received. I'll do my best to get them=
 all out in a timely manner, but please understand it is only me around her=
e doing it all (I prefer it that way). If you all swamp me out with orders =
quickly, just know that I have been doing this particular business for over=
 ten years now and have always delivered on my word. Just please be patient=
 and I will ship out as soon as I can.</p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; =
line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">Lastly, please try to find answers to yo=
ur questions on the website. I do my best to respond to all emails but it c=
an take some time since I personally respond to every one and I don't use s=
ome stupid fucking AI email bot garbage. When I get asked, &quot;When will =
these be in stock again&quot;, I simply respond over and over, please sign =
up to the newsletter to be informed all all news (I think it says this on t=
he website in at least four different places). So if you don't find what yo=
u want this time, just hang in there and pay attention to the newsletter be=
cause more is coming soon. With this said, I'll always respond to your emai=
ls, but it may take some time. Patience is something that we have lost with=
 the internet in our pocket.</p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-heigh=
t: 1.6; color: #15212A;">Let me leave you with a few thoughts on taking it =
slow. These are not meant to be inspiring or profound, but rather just a bi=
t of advice from the P.I.E. (Pre Internet Era (ish)).</p><p style=3D"margin=
: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">&quot;Said, woman, take i=
t slow, it'll work itself out fine<br>All we need is just a little patience=
<br>Said, sugar, make it slow and we'll come together fine<br>All we need i=
s just a little patience<br>Patience. Mm, yeah&quot;<br>-Axel Rose, 1989.</=
p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">&quot=
;Good things come to those who wait&quot;<br>-Guinness, 1996.</p><p style=
=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">&quot;The best =
things come to those who wait&quot;<br>-H. J. Heinz Company, 1987.</p><p st=
yle=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">&quot;I have=
 mastered the art of procrastination&quot;<br>-I think I said that, 2026.</=
p><p style=3D"margin: 0 0 1.5em 0; line-height: 1.6; color: #15212A;">Take =
it easy and enjoy while you can.<br>S.</p>
